"p18" [shape=circle width=0.25 fixedsize=true label="" fontsize=6 style=filled fillcolor="#ffffff"]
"t01" [shape=box style=rounded label="1. GMIS to Personnel unit: Approved staffing\npattern: positions, classification, salary\ngrades" tooltip="12a-01"]
"t02" [shape=box style=rounded label="2. Personnel unit to GMIS: Monthly update of\nthe plantilla of personnel in GMIS (PSIPOP):\nfilled and vacant positions" tooltip="12a-02"]
"t03" [shape=box style=rounded label="3. Head of agency to GMIS: Approval of the\nupdate in GMIS (second approver)" tooltip="12a-03"]
"t04" [shape=box style=rounded label="4. GMIS: Personnel budget of the next year\ncomputed from the FILLED positions in GMIS" tooltip="12a-04"]
"t05" [shape=box style=rounded label="5. Head of agency to Employees: Appointment to\na vacant, funded position" tooltip="12a-05"]
"t06" [shape=box style=rounded label="6. Personnel unit to CSC: Appointment papers\nfor attestation" tooltip="12a-06"]
"t07" [shape=box style=rounded label="7. CSC to Personnel unit: Attested appointment" tooltip="12a-07"]
"t08" [shape=box style=rounded label="8. Personnel unit to Budget unit: Payroll,\nprepared in advance: gross pay, deductions and\nnet pay of each employee. An authorized\nofficial certifies: services duly rendered\n(Box A)" tooltip="12a-08"]
"t09" [shape=box style=rounded label="9. Budget unit: Budget unit: obligation\nrequest. Head of accounting certifies:\ndocuments complete, cash available (Box B).\nJournal entry: salary expense, and the amounts\ndue to BIR, to the insurance bodies and to the\nemployees" tooltip="12a-09"]
"t10" [shape=box style=rounded label="10. Budget unit to Head of agency: Payroll for\napproval" tooltip="12a-10"]
"t11" [shape=box style=rounded label="11. Head of agency to Budget unit: Approved\nfor payment (Box C)" tooltip="12a-11"]
"t12" [shape=box style=rounded label="12. Accounting unit to Servicing banks:\nPayment order for the net pay: to the accounts\nof the employees, or as an advance to the\ndisbursing officer who pays in cash" tooltip="12a-12"]
"t13" [shape=box style=rounded label="13. Servicing banks to Employees: Net pay. For\ncash: each employee signs the payroll, and the\ndisbursing officer certifies that each one was\npaid (Box D)" tooltip="12a-13"]
"t14" [shape=box style=rounded label="14. Employees to Personnel unit: Reports of\nattendance, after the payroll. An overpayment\nfor an absence without pay is demanded back" tooltip="12a-14"]
"t15" [shape=box style=rounded label="15. Budget unit to GSIS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG:\nTax withheld (by Tax Remittance Advice),\npremiums and contributions of employee and\ngovernment" tooltip="12a-15"]
"tau1" [shape=box width=0.15 height=0.15 style=filled fillcolor="#444444" label="" tooltip="skip: Shortage in one personnel benefit"]
"t16" [shape=box style=rounded label="16. Head of agency to Budget unit: Advice for\nuse of PS Allotment (APSA)" tooltip="12a-16"]
"tau2" [shape=box width=0.15 height=0.15 style=filled fillcolor="#444444" label="" tooltip="end of: Shortage in one personnel benefit"]
